# Hutao Chevreuse Fischl Yae. ~17s Rot. Overload Hutao doing 6N3CJ. Hutao & Chevreuse burst every other rotation. Yae does not burst. EM build options for Hutao in config. 

# Team
# Talent DMG
hutao char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
hutao add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
